Several of these paper positions run side by side, and this one holds 5 sessions from entry

00:05:20.702 --> 00:05:26.802
or hits the stop, whichever comes first, with no discretionary exit in between. You see crude

00:05:26.802 --> 00:05:32.302
firm, the payout history stable, and the moving average line still holding. Do you treat that

