00:05:42.902 --> 00:05:48.282
whether that volume filter ever arrives during the hold. If it never does, the grade stays honest

00:05:48.282 --> 00:05:54.522
about a two-factor tape rather than pretending the third factor showed up. No five session hold closed

00:05:54.522 --> 00:05:59.762
against its own stop and invalidation on this desk today, so there is no film to grade until

00:05:59.762 --> 00:06:05.366
Interflex finishes the window it has not yet opened. Wealth Simple's portfolio organizer,

00:06:05.626 --> 00:06:11.566
under the Portfolio tab in any account, lets you tag Exchange Traded Funds or ETFs into growth,

00:06:12.146 --> 00:06:17.806
